#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:1
msgid "贡献指南"
msgstr "Contributing Guide"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:3
msgid ""
"感谢你对 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin 的关注。欢迎提交代码、文档、示例、测试和问题反馈。提交前，请先搜索现有的 "
"[Issues](https://github.com/QBoson/Kaiwu-pytorch-plugin/issues) 和 Pull "
"Requests，避免重复工作。"
msgstr ""
"Thank you for your interest in Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin. Contributions of code, "
"documentation, examples, tests, and issue reports are welcome. Before "
"contributing, please search existing "
"[Issues](https://github.com/QBoson/Kaiwu-pytorch-plugin/issues) and pull "
"requests to avoid duplicate work."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:5
msgid "第一次参与开源贡献？欢迎查看[开物量子开发者社区](https://kaiwu.qboson.com/plugin.php?id=quantumAI&type=community)的「开源贡献社区」栏目，了解社区活动、开源项目和参与方式。"
msgstr "New to open source? Visit the Open Source Contributions section of the [Kaiwu developer community](https://kaiwu.qboson.com/plugin.php?id=quantumAI&type=community) to find community events, open-source projects, and ways to get involved."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:7
msgid "科研算力激励"
msgstr "Research Computing Incentives"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:9
msgid "使用 KPP 和 Kaiwu SDK 做开发或科研，需要量子真机算力的开发者和科研人员可申请 **算力五折优惠（买 N 送 N）**。"
msgstr "Developers and researchers who need access to real quantum hardware for work with KPP and Kaiwu SDK can apply for a **50% discount on computing resources (buy N, get N free)**."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:11
msgid "申请者需在科研成果中引用或致谢 KPP 或 Kaiwu SDK，并通过[社区页面](https://kaiwu.qboson.com/plugin.php?id=quantumAI&type=community)底部的问卷提交申请。审核通过后，团队会在 3 个工作日内对接。如有疑问，请联系 [developer@boseq.com](mailto:developer@boseq.com)。"
msgstr "Cite or acknowledge KPP or Kaiwu SDK in your research outputs and apply using the questionnaire at the bottom of the [community page](https://kaiwu.qboson.com/plugin.php?id=quantumAI&type=community). The team will get in touch within 3 business days of approval. For questions, email [developer@boseq.com](mailto:developer@boseq.com)."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:13
msgid "报告问题与提出建议"
msgstr "Report Issues and Suggest Enhancements"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:7
msgid ""
"请通过 [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/QBoson/Kaiwu-pytorch-plugin/issues) "
"报告可复现的问题或提出功能建议。请提供所用的 Python、PyTorch、Kaiwu SDK 和 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin "
"版本，以及最小复现步骤、实际结果和完整报错信息。"
msgstr ""
"Use [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/QBoson/Kaiwu-pytorch-plugin/issues) "
"to report reproducible problems or suggest features. Include the versions of"
" Python, PyTorch, Kaiwu SDK, and Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin that you use, along "
"with minimal reproduction steps, the actual result, and the complete error "
"message."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:9
msgid "开始开发"
msgstr "Get Started with Development"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:11
msgid "请按项目安装文档使用 Python 3.10 和 conda 环境："
msgstr ""
"Use Python 3.10 and a conda environment as described in the project's "
"installation documentation:"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:22
msgid "Kaiwu SDK 为必需依赖。可直接安装 1.3.1 版本："
msgstr "Kaiwu SDK is required. Version 1.3.1 can be installed directly:"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:28
msgid "其他版本的安装方式请参阅[安装指南](../getting_started/installation.md)。参与开发时，额外安装开发依赖："
msgstr ""
"For other versions, see the [Installation "
"Guide](../getting_started/installation.md). To contribute to development, "
"install the additional development dependencies:"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:34
msgid "代码、测试与文档"
msgstr "Code, Tests, and Documentation"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:36
msgid "为代码改动补充或更新对应的测试。提交前运行完整测试或受影响的测试："
msgstr ""
"Add or update tests for code changes. Before submitting, run the full test "
"suite or the affected tests:"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:44
msgid "运行项目已有的代码风格检查："
msgstr "Run the project's existing code-style check:"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:50
msgid "遵循现有代码风格、类型标注和文档字符串格式；不要通过新增或扩大 pylint 的 `disable` 配置来规避检查。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the established code style, type annotations, and docstring format. "
"Do not bypass checks by adding or broadening pylint `disable` settings."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:51
msgid "用户可见行为变化时，请同步更新对应的 README、示例或 Sphinx 文档。"
msgstr ""
"When changing user-visible behavior, update the corresponding README files, "
"examples, or Sphinx documentation."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:53
msgid "更新或新增示例"
msgstr "Update or Add Examples"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:57
msgid "Q-Diffusion 的最小训练和生成示例可在仓库根目录执行："
msgstr ""
"The minimal Q-Diffusion training and generation examples can be run from the"
" repository root:"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:65
msgid ""
"新增示例时，请在 `example/` 中提供运行入口和依赖说明，并同步更新 `example/README_ZH.md` 与 "
"`example/README.md`。"
msgstr ""
"When adding an example, provide its entry point and dependency instructions "
"under `example/`, and update both `example/README_ZH.md` and "
"`example/README.md`."

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:67
msgid "提交 Pull Request"
msgstr "Submit a Pull Request"

#: ../../source/about/contributing.md:69
msgid ""
"请在 Pull Request 中说明改动目的、测试方式，以及对 README、示例或文档的更新。维护者会根据代码质量、测试覆盖和兼容性进行审阅。"
msgstr ""
"In the pull request, describe the purpose of the change, how it was tested, "
"and updates to README files, examples, or documentation. Maintainers review "
"changes for code quality, test coverage, and compatibility."

#: ../../../../Users/chang137/Documents/kaiwu_torch_plugin_docs/docs/source/about/contributing.md:54
msgid ""
"已有的基础脚本位于 `example/run_bm.py` 和 `example/run_rbm.py`。Digits、DBN、BM 生成和 Q-VAE"
" 示例通过各自目录中的 Notebook 运行，具体入口见 "
"[example/README_ZH.md](https://github.com/qboson/kaiwu-pytorch-"
"plugin/blob/main/example/README_ZH.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The existing basic scripts are `example/run_bm.py` and `example/run_rbm.py`."
" The Digits, DBN, BM-generation, and Q-VAE examples run from notebooks in "
"their respective directories; see "
"[example/README_ZH.md](https://github.com/qboson/kaiwu-pytorch-"
"plugin/blob/main/example/README_ZH.md) for entry points."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "已有的基础脚本位于 `example/run_bm.py` 和 `example/run_rbm.py`。Digits、DBN、BM 生成和 Q-VAE"
#~ " 示例通过各自目录中的 Notebook 运行，具体入口见 "
